{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"4ca2 rev7 INDETERMINATE, 1 real finding: literal marker scan not JSON-string-aware -> payload containing <<<END>>> inside a value would truncate. Fix: LINE-ANCHORED marker recognition (marker only when alone on its own line); valid JSON cannot place a bare <<<END>>> on its own physical line. Updated pairing rule + AC + oracle collision pin. Launching rev8."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785923519289515001,"uuid":"34937dce-4c30-44a1-af9f-bcd13b2c102d"}